	(text_box "SHDN DEFAULT-ON DIVIDER\n\nR6 = 680 kohm, R7 = 200 kohm (both 1%)\nVBAT_FUSED -> R6 -> SHDN_LTC -> R7 -> GND\n\nV_SHDN = VBAT_FUSED * R7 / (R6 + R7)\n= VBAT_FUSED * 200 / 880\n= 0.22727 * VBAT_FUSED\n\nAt 10.56 V input: V_SHDN = 2.40 V\nAt 14.80 V input: V_SHDN = 3.36 V\nAt 16.80 V input: V_SHDN = 3.82 V\n\nSHDN > 1.2 V enables the controller.\nInput-side bias allows startup before PDB_VOUT exists.\nNominal calculation; excludes DRAWI tolerance and pin leakage."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
